          "text": "Verification Steps for 2025",
          "variant": "h2"
        },
        {
          "id": "verification-step-1",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "1. Check current sign-up bonuses (SUBs) which fluctuate monthly.",
          "variant": "body"
        },
        {
          "id": "verification-step-2",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "2. Confirm if the card's transfer partners include ANA or Japan Airlines for maximum point value.",
